WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_AbigailIntro::
	.string "I'm beginning to get a sunburn…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_AbigailPostBattle::
	.string "I like that cap you have.\n"
	.string "Maybe I should wear one, too…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_AbigailRematchIntro::
	.string "My sunburn is starting to hurt…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_BryceDefeat::
	.string "Awww, blown!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_BryceIntro::
	.string "You know, everything tastes great\n"
	.string "when you're out in the wild.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_BrycePostBattle::
	.string "The water in volcanic regions is\n"
	.string "delicious.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_BryceRematchIntro::
	.string "You know, everything tastes great\n"
	.string "when you're out in the wild.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_ClaireDefeat::
	.string "That made me all sweaty.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_ClaireIntro::
	.string "My lunch filled us up, so will you\n"
	.string "battle us for some exercise?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_ClairePostBattle::
	.string "What should I do?\n"
	.string "I feel famished again.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_ClaireRematchIntro::
	.string "I ate too much again, so will you\n"
	.string "battle us for some exercise?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_FinnDefeat::
	.string "Well, aren't you tough?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_FinnIntro::
	.string "Seen from here, MT. EMBER towers\n"
	.string "into the sky.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_FinnPostBattle::
	.string "The sky is immense around these\n"
	.string "parts.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_FinnRematchIntro::
	.string "The fire bird's mountain casts\n"
	.string "a huge shadow…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_GarrettDefeat::
	.string "Hey, what the…\n"
	.string "You're good, you!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_GarrettIntro::
	.string "I took a break from swimming,\n"
	.string "only to have you challenge me?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_GarrettPostBattle::
	.string "Instead of using SURF all the time,\n"
	.string "you should swim some.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_GarrettRematchIntro::
	.string "I have this strong feeling that\n"
	.string "I can win this time!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_HughDefeat::
	.string "Why me?!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_HughIntro::
	.string "Dress appropriately for battle!\n"
	.string "Lose that frivolous outfit!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_HughPostBattle::
	.string "Even martial artists are becoming\n"
	.string "fashion conscious these days…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_HughRematchIntro::
	.string "Dress appropriately for battle!\n"
	.string "Lose that frivolous outfit, I said!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_KiaDefeat::
	.string "KIA: Huh?!\n"
	.string "I can't believe it!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_KiaIntro::
	.string "KIA: My big brother and I make\n"
	.string "an awesome combination!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_KiaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "KIA: If you want to battle with\n"
	.string "us, you have to bring at least two\l"
	.string "POKéMON with you.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_KiaPostBattle::
	.string "KIA: How could there be anyone\n"
	.string "better than my big brother?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_KiaRematchIntro::
	.string "KIA: My big brother and I make\n"
	.string "an awesome combination!\p"
	.string "We won't lose this time!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MariaDefeat::
	.string "Aiyeeeeh!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MariaIntro::
	.string "The weather's gorgeous!\n"
	.string "Perfect for a battle!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MariaPostBattle::
	.string "Please don't splash my face!\n"
	.string "You'll ruin the makeup.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MariaRematchIntro::
	.string "The weather's gorgeous!\n"
	.string "I'll try not to spoil it.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MikDefeat::
	.string "MIK: Whoa!\n"
	.string "That's too much!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MikIntro::
	.string "MIK: Together with KIA, I'm afraid\n"
	.string "of nothing!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MikNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MIK: Hey, do you want to battle\n"
	.string "with us two?\p"
	.string "Bring two or more POKéMON with\n"
	.string "you, then.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MikPostBattle::
	.string "MIK: How could my combination\n"
	.string "with KIA fail?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_MikRematchIntro::
	.string "MIK: Together with KIA, we're\n"
	.string "afraid of nothing!\p"
	.string "We'll prove it to you this time!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SharonDefeat::
	.string "You were a cut above me.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SharonIntro::
	.string "Could you help me out with my\n"
	.string "training?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SharonPostBattle::
	.string "It's clear that you're skilled.\n"
	.string "I like you!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SharonRematchIntro::
	.string "You'll help me out with my\n"
	.string "training again?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SheaDefeat::
	.string "Gasp…\n"
	.string "Gasp…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SheaIntro::
	.string "Every morning, before breakfast,\n"
	.string "I swim around this island.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_OneIsland_KindleRoad_Text_SheaPostBattle::
	.string "I lost because I'm pooped from all\n"
