	.string "You're as tough as I thought!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyIntro::
	.string "You look strong.\n"
	.string "Let me battle you, please!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyPostBattle::
