	.string "a lot of useful data.\p"
	.string "Thanks so much!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SevenIsland_SevaultCanyon_Text_LeroyRematchIntro::
	.string "You must have gotten tougher.\n"
	.string "Let me battle you, please!$"

