	.string "I'm beat…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_MymoRematchIntro::
	.string "Gasp… Gasp…\p"
	.string "I swam here from SIX ISLAND's port\n"
	.string "in one go again.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_NicoleDefeat::
	.string "I didn't lose to you at swimming.\n"
	.string "This doesn't bother me.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_NicoleIntro::
	.string "It's not so easy sending POKéMON\n"
	.string "out while swimming, you know?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_NicolePostBattle::
	.string "Are you headed for the island up\n"
	.string "past here?\p"
	.string "I didn't see anything interesting\n"
	.string "there.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_NicoleRematchIntro::
	.string "You always come along while I'm\n"
	.string "swimming.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_TylorDefeat::
	.string "Nope, no luck at all…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_TylorIntro::
	.string "I'm having no luck at all.\n"
	.string "A battle'd be a change of pace!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_TylorPostBattle::
	.string "I can't very well go home without\n"
	.string "catching something, though.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_OutcastIsland_Text_TylorRematchIntro::
	.string "I'm still having no luck at all.\n"
