WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_DarylDefeat::
	.string "Oh, the heartbreak of losing so\n"
	.string "easily to you!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_DarylIntro::
	.string "A battle with you, so high up!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_DarylPostBattle::
	.string "Experience the joy of climbing!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_DarylRematchIntro::
	.string "A rematch with you, so high up!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_FosterDefeat::
	.string "It's been so long since I battled,\n"
	.string "my instincts are off.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_FosterIntro::
	.string "I'm curious, what compelled you to\n"
	.string "come here?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_FosterPostBattle::
	.string "There are several ruins on the\n"
	.string "SEVII ISLANDS.\p"
	.string "The majority of them date back\n"
	.string "a long way.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_FosterRematchIntro::
	.string "Hi, didn't we meet before?\n"
	.string "What compelled you to come back?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_HectorDefeat::
	.string "You don't need to be so pushy.\n"
	.string "I'll be happy to tell you.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_HectorIntro::
	.string "I'm pretty familiar with the land\n"
	.string "around these parts.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_HectorPostBattle::
	.string "The door to the ruins…\n"
	.string "It has these strange patterns\l"
	.string "engraved on the outside.\p"
	.string "I don't know what they mean,\n"
	.string "though.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_HectorRematchIntro::
	.string "I'm pretty familiar with the land\n"
	.string "around these parts.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_LarryDefeat::
	.string "Oh, interesting.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_LarryIntro::
	.string "It's been said that there are\n"
	.string "mysterious stones on this island.\p"
	.string "I suspect it has something to do\n"
	.string "with the ruins here.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_LarryPostBattle::
	.string "Those ruins over there…\p"
	.string "I haven't had any luck in finding\n"
	.string "how I can get inside.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_LarryRematchIntro::
	.string "It's been said that there are\n"
	.string "mysterious stones on this island.\p"
	.string "Have you discovered anything since\n"
	.string "we last met?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_StanlyDefeat::
	.string "Hmm…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_StanlyIntro::
	.string "There appear to be many secrets\n"
	.string "still unsolved in this world.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_StanlyPostBattle::
	.string "I suggest to you that you, too,\n"
	.string "give a thought to the secrets and\l"
	.string "mysteries of our world once a day.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_RuinValley_Text_StanlyRematchIntro::
	.string "There appear to be many secrets\n"
	.string "still unsolved in this world.$"

