WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_DeniseDefeat::
	.string "Awww, I knew this would happen!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_DeniseIntro::
	.string "My boyfriend's always busy, so I\n"
	.string "come swimming by myself.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_DenisePostBattle::
	.string "When I can't be with my boyfriend,\n"
	.string "I spend time with the POKéMON he\l"
	.string "gave me.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_DeniseRematchIntro::
	.string "Sigh…\n"
	.string "My boyfriend's busy again…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EarlDefeat::
	.string "I lost my way while I was busy\n"
	.string "battling!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EarlIntro::
	.string "Tell me, where are the mountains\n"
	.string "around these parts?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EarlPostBattle::
	.string "Aren't there any mountains around\n"
	.string "these parts?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EarlRematchIntro::
	.string "Come on, tell me, where are the\n"
	.string "mountains around these parts?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EdwardDefeat::
	.string "Nobody saw me losing, right?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EdwardIntro::
	.string "I'm practicing in secret so no one\n"
	.string "can see me.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EdwardPostBattle::
	.string "As a performer, I don't want people\n"
	.string "to know about the effort I put in.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_EdwardRematchIntro::
	.string "Hehehe, I'm practicing in secret\n"
	.string "again.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiaDefeat::
	.string "MIA: You're mean!\n"
	.string "You're bad for winning!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiaIntro::
	.string "MIA: Hello, POKéMON!\n"
	.string "It's time to battle!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiaNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MIA: Oh, you only have one\n"
	.string "POKéMON?\p"
	.string "Don't you feel lonesome?$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiaPostBattle::
	.string "MIA: Ohh…\n"
	.string "I'm sorry, my POKéMON…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiaRematchIntro::
	.string "MIA: Hello, POKéMON!\n"
	.string "It's time to battle again!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiuDefeat::
	.string "MIU: Oh, no!\n"
	.string "Mommy!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiuIntro::
	.string "MIU: Hello, POKéMON!\n"
	.string "It's time to play!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiuNotEnoughMons::
	.string "MIU: MIA and I are TWINS.\n"
	.string "We want to battle together.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiuPostBattle::
	.string "MIU: It makes me all sad inside\n"
	.string "when we lose…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_MiuRematchIntro::
	.string "MIU: Hello, POKéMON!\n"
	.string "It's time to play again!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_RoseDefeat::
	.string "Giggle… You're so cute when you're\n"
	.string "determined.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_RoseIntro::
	.string "I let a pleasant breeze lead me\n"
	.string "all the way here.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_RosePostBattle::
	.string "I want to go to the woods over\n"
	.string "there, but…\p"
	.string "There are lots of BUG POKéMON.\n"
	.string "They scare me a little.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_RoseRematchIntro::
	.string "Oh, hello.\n"
	.string "A pleasant breeze is blowing again.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_SamirDefeat::
	.string "Oh, no, no, no.$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_SamirIntro::
	.string "What, you're suggesting that you're\n"
	.string "sick of seeing SWIMMERS like me?\p"
	.string "Aww, don't be hatin'!$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_SamirPostBattle::
	.string "I couldn't lift the stigma of being\n"
	.string "a SWIMMER…$"

WayfarerSevii_Trainer_SixIsland_WaterPath_Text_SamirRematchIntro::
	.string "What, you're sick of seeing\n"
	.string "SWIMMERS like me?\p"
	.string "Aww, don't be hatin'!\n"
	.string "Battle with me again.$"

